{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/wjad8fih","slide":4,"bbox":[0,0,1280,720]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/hkje1kzm","slide":4,"text":"STAGE 01","textPreview":"STAGE 01","textChars":8,"textLines":1,"bbox":[64,34,430,22]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/mt8v250z","slide":4,"text":"UDYAAN / SECRET PROJECT","textPreview":"UDYAAN / SECRET PROJECT","textChars":23,"textLines":1,"bbox":[910,34,300,22]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/7uhwvahk","slide":4,"bbox":[64,62,1152,0]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/8fqd4fi5","slide":4,"text":"04","textPreview":"04","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[1170,674,42,18]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/9gzexkzq","slide":4,"text":"First, students understand what the business is","textPreview":"First, students understand what the business is","textChars":47,"textLines":1,"bbox":[64,83,820,78]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6psvep0j","slide":4,"text":"They find a real problem instead of guessing what people want.","textPreview":"They find a real problem instead of guessing what people want.","textChars":62,"textLines":1,"bbox":[64,166,760,44]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/3ihovuh4","slide":4,"bbox":[554,230,660,320]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ih8nmp0j","slide":4,"text":"Students do","textPreview":"Students do","textChars":11,"textLines":1,"bbox":[582,254,190,26]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5kz6h4za","slide":4,"text":"• Choose a group of people\n• Speak to them\n• Notice what they struggle with\n• Write down what they actually say","textPreview":"• Choose a group of people | • Speak to them | • Notice what they struggle with | • Write down what they actually say","textChars":111,"textLines":4,"bbox":[582,292,570,122]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/4jq5ozip","slide":4,"text":"They leave with","textPreview":"They leave with","textChars":15,"textLines":1,"bbox":[582,440,190,26]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/r6hojehg","slide":4,"text":"Conversation notes and a clear statement of the problem they want to solve.","textPreview":"Conversation notes and a clear statement of the problem they want to solve.","textChars":75,"textLines":1,"bbox":[582,474,565,48]}
{"kind":"image","id":"im/y507a98n","slide":4,"name":"","geometry":"rect","alt":"Original playable world atmosphere","bbox":[0,0,1280,720]}
