{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/ap8qze","slide":4,"text":""}
{"kind":"slide","id":"sl/52eb3l","slide":5,"title":"STAGE 02","textShapes":9}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/4zmhsve9","slide":5,"bbox":[0,0,1280,720]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/50fy1gvu","slide":5,"text":"STAGE 02","textPreview":"STAGE 02","textChars":8,"textLines":1,"bbox":[64,34,430,22]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ut4zm1w7","slide":5,"text":"UDYAAN / SECRET PROJECT","textPreview":"UDYAAN / SECRET PROJECT","textChars":23,"textLines":1,"bbox":[910,34,300,22]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/vudgv6ds","slide":5,"bbox":[64,62,1152,0]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/gvmhobed","slide":5,"text":"05","textPreview":"05","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[1170,674,42,18]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/hwvyxgvy","slide":5,"text":"Then, students build a first version of the business","textPreview":"Then, students build a first version of the business","textChars":52,"textLines":1,"bbox":[64,83,820,78]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/epozy5cr","slide":5,"text":"They turn the problem they found into something simple that they can show people.","textPreview":"They turn the problem they found into something simple that they can show people.","textChars":81,"textLines":1,"bbox":[64,166,760,44]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/fqx07adw","slide":5,"bbox":[64,230,600,320]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/ja9gfut8","slide":5,"text":"Students decide","textPreview":"Students decide","textChars":15,"textLines":1,"bbox":[92,254,190,26]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/i90f6psn","slide":5,"text":"• Who the offer is for\n• What result it gives\n• How it will work\n• What they will say when they explain it","textPreview":"• Who the offer is for | • What result it gives | • How it will work | • What they will say when they explain it","textChars":106,"textLines":4,"bbox":[92,292,520,122]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/5cryhkbe","slide":5,"text":"They leave with","textPreview":"They leave with","textChars":15,"textLines":1,"bbox":[92,440,190,26]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/kbix8fat","slide":5,"text":"A simple offer and a first way to explain or sell it.","textPreview":"A simple offer and a first way to explain or sell it.","textChars":53,"textLines":1,"bbox":[92,474,520,48]}
