{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/rmpsfypw","slide":6,"bbox":[0,0,1280,720]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/6lgb6tob","slide":6,"text":"STAGE 03","textPreview":"STAGE 03","textChars":8,"textLines":1,"bbox":[64,34,430,22]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/1crul8ny","slide":6,"text":"UDYAAN / SECRET PROJECT","textPreview":"UDYAAN / SECRET PROJECT","textChars":23,"textLines":1,"bbox":[910,34,300,22]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/gbitcn6d","slide":6,"bbox":[64,62,1152,0]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/fa9cji5s","slide":6,"text":"06","textPreview":"06","textChars":2,"textLines":1,"bbox":[1170,674,42,18]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/e90bado7","slide":6,"text":"Finally, students put the first version in front of real people","textPreview":"Finally, students put the first version in front of real people","textChars":63,"textLines":1,"bbox":[64,83,820,78]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/hg7a9o7e","slide":6,"text":"They learn from what happens instead of treating one response as the final answer.","textPreview":"They learn from what happens instead of treating one response as the final answer.","textChars":82,"textLines":1,"bbox":[64,166,760,44]}
{"kind":"shape","id":"sh/edoj6587","slide":6,"bbox":[554,230,660,320]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/fyxkzq9s","slide":6,"text":"Students do","textPreview":"Students do","textChars":11,"textLines":1,"bbox":[582,254,190,26]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/0z6l8vqd","slide":6,"text":"• Reach out to people\n• Show the offer\n• Listen for interest, confusion, and objections\n• Decide what to change next","textPreview":"• Reach out to people | • Show the offer | • Listen for interest, confusion, and objections | • Decide what to change next","textChars":116,"textLines":4,"bbox":[582,292,570,122]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/10z210ry","slide":6,"text":"They leave with","textPreview":"They leave with","textChars":15,"textLines":1,"bbox":[582,440,190,26]}
{"kind":"textbox","id":"sh/2183a58j","slide":6,"text":"A record of feedback and a clearer next step for the business.","textPreview":"A record of feedback and a clearer next step for the business.","textChars":62,"textLines":1,"bbox":[582,474,565,48]}
